      "id": "sol.ahsme-1963-p8.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(1260=2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5\\cdot7,\\) the least multiplier making every exponent divisible by \\(3\\) is \\[2\\cdot3\\cdot5^2\\cdot7^2=7350.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
